{"3681450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DUMMY HOUSE", "steam_appid": 3681450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4747790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/b6f83b57c2d8d246acf5838c3e631e04.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=616 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/b6f83b57c2d8d246acf5838c3e631e04.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/b6f83b57c2d8d246acf5838c3e631e04.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/a453b4a3397d1195daf383525d29c3b1.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/a453b4a3397d1195daf383525d29c3b1.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/a453b4a3397d1195daf383525d29c3b1.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped inside a sealed industrial complex, with no human contact, and must survive the “Experiment Nights”. The dark corridors are inhabited by entities known as &quot;Dummy&quot; — imperfect copies of human beings that have learned to imitate our gestures, voices, and expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/723dbca35791bd7a9c5254852a3df98b.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=616 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/723dbca35791bd7a9c5254852a3df98b.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/723dbca35791bd7a9c5254852a3df98b.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/13ba5cc30b6b6110e6499a79f7e2123f.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/13ba5cc30b6b6110e6499a79f7e2123f.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/13ba5cc30b6b6110e6499a79f7e2123f.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only tool at your disposal is a camera. Use sound to guide yourself, track the &quot;Dummy&quot; subjects in the dark and photograph them to repel their approach. As you hear footsteps and voices getting closer and closer. Your mind and reflexes will be constantly put to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/7443c3eeb33eb7ff8836921f56db14cf.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=616 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/7443c3eeb33eb7ff8836921f56db14cf.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/7443c3eeb33eb7ff8836921f56db14cf.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/66135b0026dc17d5f02d9060c2aca245.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=720 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/66135b0026dc17d5f02d9060c2aca245.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/66135b0026dc17d5f02d9060c2aca245.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply hiding is not enough — each night demands strategy and quick decisions. Survive multiple enemies at the same time while trying to find a way out through the computer terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/c21317b2e235c4ae48b54a866b350378.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=616 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/c21317b2e235c4ae48b54a866b350378.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/c21317b2e235c4ae48b54a866b350378.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple different endings, the game’s universe is shrouded in mysteries that connect according to your gameplay style. It is up to you to piece together the investigation and discover how far this story goes and what your role is in all of this.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📸 Innovative mechanic:</strong> Use sound as guidance and the camera to drive enemies away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Strategic survival:</strong> Manage every decision and every photograph, knowing that one mistake can be fatal<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎧 Immersive atmosphere:</strong> Complete darkness, 3D audio, and a reactive environment with tension increasing every night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👁️ Intense psychological horror</strong> — Face enemies that imitate humans, causing constant discomfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔀 Multiple endings</strong> — Different outcomes reveal hidden layers of the story and the game’s universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>♻️ High replayability</strong> — Customizable stages, every attempt brings new challenges, combinations, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/b6f83b57c2d8d246acf5838c3e631e04.poster.avif?t=1785870022\" width=616 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/b6f83b57c2d8d246acf5838c3e631e04.webm?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/b6f83b57c2d8d246acf5838c3e631e04.mp4?t=1785870022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681450/extras/a453b4a3397d1195